        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(agent): synchronize AgentTurnBoundary hasPerceived updates",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n`AgentTurnBoundary` is `@unchecked Sendable` and mutated `hasPerceived` inside `record` without synchronization.\n\nThis PR serializes `record` state access with an `NSLock` and adds a concurrent regression test.\n\n## Failure scenario\n\n1. Multiple concurrent tool completions call `record` on the same boundary.\n2. Unsynchronized `hasPerceived` read/write can miss a stop decision.\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nConcurrent `record` after perceive under an NSLock (same control shape as production):\n\n```\nCONCURRENT_STOPS=32\nPROOF_OK\n```\n\nAlso: `swift build --target PeekabooAgentRuntime` → complete.\n\n## Scope\n\n`AgentTurnBoundary.record` state only.",
